  "semanticInvariants": [
    "Normalize diagonal movement to length at most one; reject non-finite numbers before simulation.",
    "Maximum client message 2048 bytes; input at most 60/s per peer, latest sequence only. Repeated violations disconnect with a localized reason.",
    "Buy only during shop, compatible class, affordable exact server price, unique transaction ID; deduct once.",
